OL,3,ARussell Brand accuser says alleged rape
OL,4,Aleft her afraid she may be pregnant
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FA woman who alleges Russell Brand raped
OL,10,Fher in a hotel has said she was left
OL,11,Ffeeling "dirty" and afraid she may be
OL,12,Fpregnant in the aftermath of the
OL,13,Falleged attack.
OL,15,FThe 51-year-old actor and comedian
OL,16,Ffaces seven charges - three counts of
OL,17,Frape, three charges of sexual assault
OL,18,Fand one of indecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/18
