OL,3,AAt the Brooklyn shop in 'surreal' row
OL,4,Awith Kelly Clarkson over mechanical
OL,5,Abird
OL,6,
OL,7,FArt of Play has found itself at the
OL,8,Fcentre of a social media storm since
OL,9,Fthe weekend when Grammy-winning
OL,10,Fmusician Kelly Clarkson complained
OL,11,Fonline that the boutique store would
OL,12,Fnot let her buy a singing and dancing
OL,13,Fmechanical bird that was perched on the
OL,14,Fwall.
OL,16,FThe Since U Been Gone singer claimed
OL,17,Fshe was "looked at as if I couldn't
OL,18,Fafford" the bird - which she said had a
OL,19,Fprice tag of $15,000 (#11,000).
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
